ad6END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_GeneralCityStreets_MaterialTests</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_GeneralCityStreets_MaterialTests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_GeneralCityStreets_MaterialTests\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">8f6cd876-01bc-4799-9a18-cb9a459f19c5</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:8f6cd876-01bc-4799-9a18-cb9a459f19c5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:8f6cd876-01bc-4799-9a18-cb9a459f19c5\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a table in the private room of the <a href=\"/wiki/Chromatic_Scale\" title=\"Chromatic Scale\">Chromatic Scale</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-178&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-57</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Notes on tests of different materials for lute strings. \n</p><p><br>\nThe prohibition against livestock in the city has always been a nuisance, but the <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute\" title=\"Absolute\">Absolute</a> army's interdiction of trade has made the problem critical. In short, where am I to get sheepgut for lute strings? This will be a record of experiments in hopes of finding an available alternative with both good tone and durability. -T.C. \n</p><p><br>\n- Ratgut. Negative: too short, not easily processed into fibre, squeaks when played. \n</p><p>- Human hair. Negative: poor tone, breaks easily. \n</p><p>- Peafowl gizzard. Negative: gross, just gross. \n</p><p>- Catgut. Negative: actually better in every way than sheepgut, but sourcing the material in the local neighbourhood provokes death threats.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202927\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1350/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26402/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7928/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935684/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.916      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   39.916      1 -total\n 50.35%   20.097      6 Template:Icon_text\n 44.85%   17.904     15 Template:Trim\n 24.52%    9.789      2 Template:Uid\n 15.90%    6.346      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.03%    5.602      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.57%    4.218      1 Template:Books\n 10.48%    4.184      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.32%    4.120      2 